\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S2}{\ignorespaces Distance-dependent orientational pair correlations between macro-ions for the three charged variants $P^{0}_{0}$ (dotted), $P^{1}_{8}$ (dashed), and $P^{2}_{8}$ (solid) as a function of center-of-mass separation $r$. (a)\nobreakspace  {}Dipole--dipole correlation $\langle \hat  {\mu }_i\cdot \hat  {\mu }_j\rangle $; (b)\nobreakspace  {}longitudinal dipole projection $\langle (\hat  {\mu }_i\cdot \hat  {r}_{ij})(\hat  {\mu }_j\cdot \hat  {r}_{ij})\rangle $; (c)\nobreakspace  {}nematic order parameter $\langle P_2(\cos \theta _{ij})\rangle =(3\cos ^2\theta _{ij}-1)/2$; (d)\nobreakspace  {}quadrupole--quadrupole correlation $\langle \hat  {\mathbf  {Q}}_i{:}\hat  {\mathbf  {Q}}_j\rangle $. Shaded bands: mean $\pm $ SEM across replicas. Horizontal gray line: uncorrelated reference ($= 0$).}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:multi_corr_exp}{{S2}{5}}
