\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces Distance-dependent pairwise energy contributions between macro-ions from explicit-ion simulations, for the three charged variants $P^{0}_{0}$ (dotted), $P^{1}_{8}$ (dashed), and $P^{2}_{8}$ (solid) as a function of center-of-mass separation $r$. (a)\nobreakspace  {}Exact total energy $u_\text  {exact}$; (b)\nobreakspace  {}multipole-expanded total $u_\text  {tot}$; (c)\nobreakspace  {}ion--ion $u_{ii}$; (d)\nobreakspace  {}ion--dipole $u_{id}$; (e)\nobreakspace  {}dipole--dipole $u_{dd}$; (f)\nobreakspace  {}ion--quadrupole $u_{iq}$. Shaded bands: mean $\pm $ SEM across replicas.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
